				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					40.447
				</span></i>
			:—mostly in 
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεγόμφωται σκάφος</span> the
			ship's hull <i>is ready built</i>, <i><span class="en">
